### PayVerse — notification-service through the gateway. Messages are MOCK: read them in the
### notification-service log ("[MOCK PUSH] ..."). Admin calls need a token for a mobile in ADMIN_MOBILES
### (log in with it in 01-auth.http and store it as adminToken).

### My inbox (newest first, with the unread count)
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/notifications/me?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

> {% if (response.body.items.length > 0) client.global.set("notificationId", response.body.items[0].id); %}

### Mark one as read
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/notifications/me/{{notificationId}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Admin: list templates (ADMIN or SUPPORT)
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/templates
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin: edit a template (ADMIN). Placeholders look like {{amount}}; unknown ones render empty.
PUT {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/templates/PAYMENT_RECEIVED/PUSH
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "subject": "Money received", "body": "INR {{amount}} just landed in your wallet.", "active": true }

### Admin: requeue a DEAD notification (ADMIN)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/notifications/{{notificationId}}/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin: dead-lettered Kafka messages from every service (onlyOpen=false includes replayed ones)
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/dead-letters?onlyOpen=true
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

> {% if (response.body.items.length > 0) client.global.set("deadLetterId", response.body.items[0].id); %}

### Admin: replay a dead letter to its original topic (ADMIN; consumers de-duplicate on eventId)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/dead-letters/{{deadLetterId}}/replay
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
